    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get the \"rest\" thing, but it feels deeper than just needing sleep. it feels like the more i learn about how huge and empty everything is, the more it feels like being alive is just... an imposition. like we're forced into this struggle for no reason. do you ever feel like the struggle itself is just fundamentally illogical?",
